            <ArticleTitle>[Double-blind parallel clinical trial with tenoxicam in comparison with indomethacin in the treatment of rheumatoid arthritis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The comparative effects of tenoxicam and indomethacin are studied in 20 patients with rheumatoid arthritis. Ten evolutive parameters were studied after six weeks of treatment. Both drugs showed similar tolerance and efficacy on the evolution of the disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
